    "done_when": "reckon/_store.py:write_json_atomically gains keyword parameters, each defaulting to today's behaviour, for what the migrated callers do differently:\n- indent;\n- sort_keys;\n- a file mode applied to the temporary before the rename;\n- fsync_directory, which fsyncs the parent directory after the rename.\nNo second writer is added.\n\nThese writers stop writing JSON through their own temporary-and-rename code and call it instead:\n- reckon/_backends.py:_write_private_json\n- reckon/capabilities.py:rebuild_capabilities\n- reckon/crew/fleet_supervisor.py:_write_json\n- reckon/crew/placement.py:publish_reservation\n- reckon/crew/plan_review.py:store_plan_review\n- reckon/resources.py:migrate_typed_layout\n- reckon/serve.py:_store_git_creation_cache\n- reckon/serve.py:_store_git_last_modified_cache\n\nEach keeps, through the new parameters, its current serialisation, file mode, fsync and locking. _write_private_json keeps its owner-only mode. A private helper left with no caller is deleted.\n\nThe numeric decoders reckon/_backends.py:_number and reckon/crew/carryover_census.py:_measured call reckon._observations.optional_number, keeping any caller-specific policy in a line around the call.\n\nBefore editing, record at base a7895e72 each writer's output bytes and file mode for one fixed payload, and each decoder's output over True, False, 0, 1.5, \"1\", None and a list. Commit both as the expectations of tests/test_writer_callers_first_wave.py, which asserts the migrated callers reproduce them byte for byte. The same file also:\n- asserts a failure injected into the shared writer mid-write leaves the target holding either the old or the new content;\n- asserts fsync_directory fsyncs the directory, by patching os.fsync.\n\nThat file, tests/test_one_atomic_writer_and_number_decoder.py, tests/test_mcp_store.py, and the existing test file of each touched module that has one, pass at exit 0. The manifest records base and head arms over the same file set in the armed JSON form with their FAILED ids, and the head arm runs at the committed head. The declared negative control is applied, the owner-only mode case is observed to fail, and that log's absolute path is in the manifest with an EXIT= line and the FAILED id. The full project suite is not run by this node.",
    "estimated_hours": null,
